  "description": "<p>This Christian rug offers an inspiring floral design, perfect for enhancing any living space with a touch of faith. Made with soft polyester fabric, it provides comfort underfoot and features an anti-slip backing for safety. This versatile area rug can also be personalized with a name or text, making it a thoughtful gift or a unique addition to your home.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational floral design with Christian themes.</li>\n<li>Personalize with your name, family name, or a special message.</li>\n<li>Crafted from soft polyester fabric for a comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for added safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for various settings including living rooms, bedrooms, and offices.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Entryways, Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Offices, Gamer Rooms, Reading Nooks, Meditation Corners, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Personalized with Name or Text, Anti-slip backing, Wrinkle-resistant, Fade-resistant, Long-lasting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Christian, Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester Fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning; machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Machine Washable, Vacuum</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for enhancing spiritual and interior atmospheres in various settings. It is suitable for entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, meditation corners, and as a decorative piece in churches.</p>",
